**Read:** [Air-cleaning systems — DOE-HDBK-1169-2022](../sources/Air-Cleaning-Handbook-DOE.lingua#r_09QPEZ76E9W6HS7R55X2K8TB3X), full filtration, housing, fan and relevant test chapters; [Multizone airflow and contaminants — Dols and Polidoro, CONTAM 3.4](../sources/CONTAM-Multizone-Airflow-and-Contaminants-NIST.lingua#r_5HECDC480RSYAJ3SQ2QNFHCN46), contaminant and airflow theory.

Start with a process, a source spectrum and required observations. Connect room inventory, capture, media survival, leakage, fan/system curves, installed distribution and captured-material handling. Keep source changes and failure states within the study.

**Work:** Recompute at least one steady and one transient balance independently. Compare number and mass efficiency, a common bypass and staged filtration. Propagate an uncertain source or flow into the result. Defend the measurement locations and explain what the proposed tests do and do not establish about useful function.

**Return:** [Clean manufacturing and contamination control — from familiar objects to controlled processes](../Clean-manufacturing-and-contamination-control.lingua#r_7D8SQ8BVQDZQBDBGC6DP0JAMZN).
